<title>USA: Citibank joins AOL online banking.</title>
<headline>Citibank joins AOL online banking.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank said Thursday it had teamed with America Online Inc to provide online banking, becoming the latest in a slew of major banks which joined AOL's Online Banking Center.</p>
<p>Citibank said the online service will initially provide customer information and offer transaction services in the future.</p>
<p>Citibank, a unit of Citicorp, is one of 19 financial institutions to provide online banking services through America Online. Others include First Chicago NBC Corp and CoreStates Financial Corp.</p>
</text>
